ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/8bf10905b185ec34648bc26a93ead2d0.poster.avif?t=1761733258\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/8bf10905b185ec34648bc26a93ead2d0.webm?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/8bf10905b185ec34648bc26a93ead2d0.mp4?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/464f873c052c3a9e065117033bf0fe74.poster.avif?t=1761733258\" width=1170 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/464f873c052c3a9e065117033bf0fe74.webm?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/464f873c052c3a9e065117033bf0fe74.mp4?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps\u2026 you\u2019ll even share your Flow with the <strong>Goddess of Yoga</strong> herself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/8e561d90bdf681c42b96bbece753633c.poster.avif?t=1761733258\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/8e561d90bdf681c42b96bbece753633c.webm?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/8e561d90bdf681c42b96bbece753633c.mp4?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your studio, face off against rival instructors, and make them yield\u2026 <br>or crush them completely<br>With your hands-on guidance, lead everyone toward enlightenment\u2014 <br>and <strong>experience tranquility.</strong> Abhyasa and Vairagya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/06b3393b1f3e324e77d9c13b3a2d1081.avif?t=1761733258\" width=1240 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your yoga business, guide your students into the <strong>perfect</strong> positions with your own hands, reap your fortune, and deepen intimacy through every session. <br>In this cheerful little town, carve out your own Yoga Empire..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/b729e072ba2e6fe8f6ee875c2e85145f.poster.avif?t=1761733258\" width=990 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/b729e072ba2e6fe8f6ee875c2e85145f.webm?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150170/extras/b729e072ba2e6fe8f6ee875c2e85145f.mp4?t=1761733258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond just story and mouse clicks\u2014our <strong>Lesson Design</strong> system throws you right into playful Intimate Sessions with your clients.<br>Drag, tap, and adjust each pose\u2026 and if things get unexpectedly steamy, just focus on your <strong>Flow</strong>. <br>Two human beings, ONE Flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar